{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:27 2026-06-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:27 2026-06-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:27 2026-06-20 HKT</p><p>今（20日）下午2時45分，一部載客的士沿火炭穗禾路往穗禾苑方向，駛至穗禾路1號對開，突失控剷上左邊行人路，再撞豐利工業中心一道捲閘及裝飾板，的士上一名男乘客撞傷頭流血，仍然清醒，救護員接報到場，將他送往沙田威爾斯親王醫院治理，的士左車頭撞毀，稍後被拖走檢驗。警方正調查意外原因。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f139dd636caa04a1ffe040da4f68dfb/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_06_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"的士稍後被拖走檢驗。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/eb32b811125ed8690e5c2e61e2b1dc75/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_06_36_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"的士左車頭撞毀。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3ecc89eda4a89985f7e2afd7f2ecf5b5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_06_36_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工廈捲閘被撞毀。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9a0173a7f34a8b1e80a3588e74a3f133/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_06_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0af5d739a8026a6f351788bf013a0383/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_06_36.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-20T08:39:32.380376+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}